  Анализ ошибок, Экспорт
- KPI cards, activity bar chart, score distribution, learning curve,
  sound accuracy, confusion matrix (top errors), CSV export
- Dashboard visible only to admin users in Navigation
- Added recharts@2.12.7 dependency
- Light Ant Design theme matching existing app style

